        "text": "Customizing a Virtual Machine\nBefore you can start entering your virtual world, you need to do a little more setup\nof your virtual machine. The New Virtual Machine Wizard sets up a generic envi-\nronment, so you want to spruce things up a bit first. This section walks through\nhow to customize the virtual machine and how to load your operating system in\nthe virtual machine.\nFIGURE 20-3:\nSetting the virtual\nserver hard disk\nfile location\nand size.\nFIGURE 20-4:\nThe virtual server\nentry in the\nVirtualBox\nwindow.\n388   PART 4 Junior Administrator Boot Camp\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Changing settings\n\u2022 Installing an OS\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
